name placing a limit order from the ticket, then cancelling it
show-buy Oil
click FinanceOverhaulOrderTabLimit
type FinanceOverhaulShareAmountField 3
type FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField 1
click Button
expect-orders-delta 1
expect-log orders: placed
expect-hidden FinanceOverhaulOrderTabLimit
cancel-new-orders
expect-orders-delta 0
cleanup:
cancel-new-orders
close-dialog
